# Regression game input (tools/regress/hatari/drive.py format): times are
# seconds from the program start. Worked out in Hatari 2.4.1, plain ST,
# TOS 2.06, 4 MB, 22 Nov 2026; "mark play" is where gameplay was on screen.
start D:\SHADBE2\RUNME.TOS
seconds 200
shots 6
4 key 0x39
20 fire
40 fire
50 key 0x39       # "insert Beast II disk two, press any key"
60 fire
80 fire
100 fire
120 fire
140 fire
160 fire
165 joy1 right
180 mark play     # first screen after the long intro
190 joy1 -
